

**Example 15**: _Given \(\xi\)=10\(-\)15i, \(g_{1}\)=8, \(g_{3}\)=4, find \(z\). Using the reversed series 18.5.40 with \(\gamma_{2}\)=.14583, \(\gamma_{3}\)=.05_

